    "question": {
        "text": "§\n\nWhat are third generation cephalosporins used to treat?",
        "imageIds": []
    },
    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nWhat are third generation cephalosporins used to treat?\n\n(1) Meningitis\n(2) Community & Hospital acquired pneumonia\n\n(3) Pseudomonas infection\n\n(4) Endocarditis\n\n(5) Gram (-) GI bugs\n\n(6) Gonorrhea\n\n(7) Lyme disease (late stage)\n\n(Only Ceftazidime can treat pseudomonas)\n\n[Image: d565ba10f4b3b1ef6e199c1a1ee5db743a11928009fbae5d07b08ba1e9bd54e7]\n\n[Image: e92afc73ab96662733b3e32d33a3cda500d1392ee5a6bab3a600db2f0d0a553d]\n\n[Image: 47f4175021457f36d8d3418874f9dba2d5fa5916aa964d42a298006b306de5fb]\n\n[Image: 2c78219cc0261c59c080a8f5c4a4bc6a90aa835e220bdfe075feaff9f8f149c8]\n\n[Image: 4cb6519045b14f0d2935bedaa121af5f5a718240e22522baf40e5fd792925d24]\n\n[Image: 18f328ffd4a61c12941f3910d0d05e6d09a4bbc6f8eb311521dd6caf6d0b4810]\n\n1.4 - Cephalosporins\n[Image: b0ee60188020980c9ca1fee3403f12f3de6b38a960acb6dab4f74d7694bc03cb]\n\n[Image: baa9a42452ede300b4b20246eaf38bc2c1f71d244e0d82d4e5b1439dd976cf54]\n\n[Image: 602c1422ee0f9457e34f0ca3a0f1a24ba7d20a0e577996ff705ecdf7cccacc10]",
